{"symbol":"STML","yahoo":"STML.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Steelman Telecom Limited","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Telecom Services","website":"https://www.steelmantelecom.com","about":"Steelman Telecom Limited provides telecommunications infrastructure and managed services to telecom operators, original equipment manufacturers, and enterprise customers in India. The company provides site preparation; installation of hardware such as routers, switches, antennas, and transmission equipment; configuration of network software and protocols; testing, optimization, and validation to ensure performance, security, and compliance; and network planning, cable laying, system integration, and troubleshooting during deployment. It also offers radio frequency services, including single cell function tests and single site/cluster verification tests; drive test analysis; analysing voice over long-term evolution performance; investigating and resolving dropped call issues; conducting interference analysis to identify and mitigate signal disruptions; evaluating traffic patterns; and identifying and analyzing worst-performing cells for targeted optimization and improvement. In addition, the company provides engineering procurement construction management services comprising designing projects, sourcing materials and equipment, and managing construction processes. Further, it offers operations and maintenance services; technology solutions; manpower outsourcing and payrolling services; civil contracting, electrical contracting, and mechanical contracting services; and charging solutions. The company was incorporated in 2003 and is headquartered in Kolkata, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T08:36:22+00:00","quote":{"price":81.0,"prevClose":85.36,"marketCap":78.38,"high52":114.65,"low52":49.0,"pe":null,"bookValue":29.6,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":-51.14,"shares":0.9676,"insiders":75.36,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2022-10-10","2022-10-11","2022-10-1